# Files in this repository that must never be served as part of the site.
#
# assets.directory in wrangler.jsonc is the repository root, so without this list
# Cloudflare uploads and serves the source. Before this file existed, all of these
# returned 200 on the live site: /src/bank_quant.js and every other item bank,
# /src/engine.js, /src/build.py, /CLAUDE.md, /data/DATA.md and /wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Anything the built pages reference must stay OUT of this list. design/ is referenced
# (/design/assets, /design/missing.png), and icons/, og/, robots.txt, llms.txt and
# manifest.json are all served deliberately. src/smoke_redirect.js asserts both
# directions so this cannot drift.
#
# Excluding src/ does not affect the worker: main is bundled into the Worker script
# rather than uploaded as an asset, which is the documented pattern.

# Source of the site. The built output lives at the repository root and is what ships.
src/
data/
supabase/

# The design system is tooling, not part of the site: 114 files including a 98 KB bundle,
# the component sources and their prompt files. Three things in it ARE part of the site and
# must survive: assets/ holds the logo, and terms.html and privacy.html load styles.css,
# which is nothing but six @imports of tokens/. Excluding those two shipped the legal pages
# with no font, no colour and no background. The guard in src/smoke_redirect.js now derives
# what must be served from the built pages themselves rather than from a list kept by hand,
# because the hand kept list is what got this wrong.
design/*
!design/assets/
!design/tokens/
!design/styles.css

# Repository and tooling files. .git matters most: Workers static assets, unlike Pages,
# does NOT exclude it automatically, so the build clone's .git was being served. /.git/config
# gave out the origin remote and /.git/index gave out the full inventory of every path this
# file is meant to hide, which defeated the point of the rest of the list.
**/.git
.git/
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
.github/
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc

# Internal documentation. CLAUDE.md in particular carries the Supabase project ref, the
# Stripe account id and both admin email addresses.
CLAUDE.md
README.md
ROADMAP.md
HANDOFF.md
DEVSECOPS.md
GROWTH.md
INTEGRATIONS.md
I18N.md
DATA_COLLECTION.md
docs/

# The Build Playbook. Generated into playbook/ as Markdown, HTML, PDF and Word, and it is
# internal: it names the infrastructure, quotes the rules file, and its defect ledger is a
# list of this platform's historical weaknesses with the commits that fixed them. Useful
# to the owner, a gift to anyone else. The bootstrap pack under it carries the same
# content in a more concentrated form.
playbook/
